        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/bcef8e/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-22T22:13:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Personally, I see nothing wrong with Thermal Shockwave activating and then AZ going out.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;This is a game of superheroic combat.&nbsp; Sacrifice is one of the cornerstones of superheroic combat.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Abilities should active the moment they are paid for.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
